member.param:
Hull state.  lists
            every hull-fixed mass entry (hull shell, mast, …). Multi-hull v1 is single-hull;
            when multi-hull lands this overload should accept IReadOnlyList<HullState>.

member.remarks:
Element naming follows the rest of the codebase: Mij is the entry at row i,
column j (1-indexed). For a body-frame inertia tensor, M11 = Ixx, M22 = Iyy, M33 = Izz;
off-diagonals are the products of inertia.

